<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Anamint year share rises.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Anamint year share rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     619	   vs 457</p>
<p>    Final div (cts)	 490	   vs 357</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   619.0	 vs 457.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   622.0	 vs 459.0</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.0	   vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Investment income     624.0	 vs 466.0</p>
<p>Div payable June 6</p>
<p>on register May 2</p>
<p>Full name: Anglo American Investment Trust Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm's major asset is a holding of 98.2 million De Beers/Centenary linked units.</p>
